    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.completion\n\n### Question\n\nI have the following config to make neovim have a readline-like behavior in INSERT mode:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.keymap.set({ \"c\", \"i\" }, \"<C-F>\", \"<Right>\", { desc = \"Forward char\" })\r\nvim.keymap.set({ \"c\", \"i\" }, \"<C-B>\", \"<Left>\", { desc = \"Backward char\" })\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"i\", \"<C-N>\", \"<Down>\", { desc = \"Next line\" })\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"i\", \"<C-P>\", \"<Up>\", { desc = \"Prev line\" })\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter enabled `mini.completion`, <kbd>C-n</kbd> and <kbd>C-p</kbd> still works, while <kbd>C-f</kbd> and <kbd>C-b</kbd> not.\r\n\r\nHow to solve this problem? thanks in advance :)",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.completion</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I have the following config to make neovim have a readline-like behavior in INSERT mode:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.keymap.set({ &quot;c&quot;, &quot;i&quot; }, &quot;&lt;C-F&gt;&quot;, &quot;&lt;Right&gt;&quot;, { desc = &quot;Forward char&quot; })\nvim.keymap.set({ &quot;c&quot;, &quot;i&quot; }, &quot;&lt;C-B&gt;&quot;, &quot;&lt;Left&gt;&quot;, { desc = &quot;Backward char&quot; })\nvim.keymap.set(&quot;i&quot;, &quot;&lt;C-N&gt;&quot;, &quot;&lt;Down&gt;&quot;, { desc = &quot;Next line&quot; })\nvim.keymap.set(&quot;i&quot;, &quot;&lt;C-P&gt;&quot;, &quot;&lt;Up&gt;&quot;, { desc = &quot;Prev line&quot; })\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>({ <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>c<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>i<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>}, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;C-F&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;Right&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Forward char<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>({ <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>c<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>i<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>}, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;C-B&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;Left&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Backward char<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>i<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;C-N&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;Down&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Next line<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>i<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;C-P&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;Up&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Prev line<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After enabled <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.completion</code>, <kbd>C-n</kbd> and <kbd>C-p</kbd> still works, while <kbd>C-f</kbd> and <kbd>C-b</kbd> not.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">How to solve this problem? thanks in advance :)</p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.completion\nQuestion\nI have the following config to make neovim have a readline-like behavior in INSERT mode:\nvim.keymap.set({ \"c\", \"i\" }, \"<C-F>\", \"<Right>\", { desc = \"Forward char\" })\nvim.keymap.set({ \"c\", \"i\" }, \"<C-B>\", \"<Left>\", { desc = \"Backward char\" })\nvim.keymap.set(\"i\", \"<C-N>\", \"<Down>\", { desc = \"Next line\" })\nvim.keymap.set(\"i\", \"<C-P>\", \"<Up>\", { desc = \"Prev line\" })\nAfter enabled mini.completion, C-n and C-p still works, while C-f and C-b not.\nHow to solve this problem? thanks in advance :)",
